 medium bomber aircraft of the Luftwaffe at the start of the war, but its weak armament was exposed during the Battle of Britain, and despite constant modifications and upgrades it became obsolete during the latter stages of the war. The He 111 was used in most theaters of the war and used in various roles, such as strategic bomber, torpedo bomber, medium bomber and a transport aircraft. A total of 5,656 Heinkel He 111 were produced, including many variants.","LocalizedString":"The Heinkel He 111 was a German medium bomber that was produced between 1935-1944 and used by the Luftwaffe during WWII. The He 111 was the most numerous medium bomber aircraft of the Luftwaffe at the start of the war, but its weak armament was exposed during the Battle of Britain, and despite constant modifications and upgrades it became obsolete during the latter stages of the war. The He 111 was used in most theaters of the war and used in various roles, such as strategic bomber, torpedo bomber, medium bomber and a transport aircraft. A total of 5,656 Heinkel He 111 were produced, including many variants."},"operationCost":2,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Uncommon","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::WorldAtWar","isInPermanentPool":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Explosion02'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/StarterContent/Audio/Explosion02.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Germany/CandidateArtwork/t_heinkel_he_111.t_heinkel_he_111","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Doug Post","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/HEINKEL_HE_111.HEINKEL_HE_111","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":334.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_germany","Key":"card_unit_heinkel_he_111_waw_photo","SourceString":"A Heinkel He 111P on a bombing mission over Poland, September 1939.","LocalizedString":"A Heinkel He 111P on a bombing mission over Poland, September 1939."},"blowUpExplosion":{"ObjectName":"Par